<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-13-morphology-audit-hoffmann-wing-venation-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hoffmann-Donoughe insect wing venation — Code-to-model traceability: 75/100" ;
    rdfs:comment "Docstring maps steps 1-5 to the paper's procedure; individual functions are not annotated with SI section numbers. Evidence: 2018-hoffmann-wing-venation.py L12–L32: procedure steps in module docstring <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/f3fe478/2018-hoffmann-wing-venation.py#L12-L32>." ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:evaluatesHypothesis <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-hoffmann-wing-venation-code-traceability> ;
    pk:hasProbability 7.5e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-13-morphology-audit-hoffmann-wing-venation-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hoffmann-Donoughe insect wing venation — Model fidelity to source: 85/100" ;
    rdfs:comment "Implements the paper's SI 3.3-3.4 model (inhibitory centres, Lloyd/centroidal-Voronoi equilibration, Voronoi secondary veins) on the real primary scaffold. Density is taken from the real wing's distance transform rather than from primary-vein thickness as in the paper; the equilibration stop criterion is a fixed 18 iterations rather than the paper's 0.1%-of-wing-length motion threshold. Evidence: 2018-hoffmann-wing-venation.py L150–L185: model_wing: density-weighted seeding, Lloyd loop, Voronoi boundaries <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/f3fe478/2018-hoffmann-wing-venation.py#L150-L185>; 2018-hoffmann-wing-venation.py L111–L133: segment_wing: real mask, primary scaffold, local cell size <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/f3fe478/2018-hoffmann-wing-venation.py#L111-L133>." ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:evaluatesHypothesis <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-hoffmann-wing-venation-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:hasProbability 8.5e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-13-morphology-audit-hoffmann-wing-venation-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hoffmann-Donoughe insect wing venation — Morphometric validation: 80/100" ;
    rdfs:comment "Circularity (Crofton perimeter), normalised area and proximal-distal circularity are computed for real and model domains and compared against the regular-hexagon ceiling, matching the paper's analysis. Evidence: 2018-hoffmann-wing-venation.py L188–L201: domain_stats: 4*pi*A/P^2 with perimeter_crofton <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/f3fe478/2018-hoffmann-wing-venation.py#L188-L201>; 2018-hoffmann-wing-venation.py L69–L69: HEXAGON_CIRC = pi*sqrt(3)/6 <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/f3fe478/2018-hoffmann-wing-venation.py#L69-L69>. Measurements (measure_outputs.py): mean domain circularity, model wing = 0.867 ratio (4πA/P²) (reference 0.712, same statistic on the authors' segmented real wing (Hoffmann et al. 2018 example)) [script's domain_stats() over Voronoi domains after Lloyd equilibration (seed 0)] — regular hexagon = 0.907; model n=923, real n=923; vein-domain count, model wing = 923 count (reference 923, same count on the real wing) [domains large enough to measure, model] — equal by construction: the model is seeded with the real wing's domain count; vein-domain count, real wing (all) = 923 count [peaks of the distance transform inside the segmented real wing] — wing area 1905316 px." ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:evaluatesHypothesis <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-hoffmann-wing-venation-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:hasProbability 8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-13-morphology-audit-hoffmann-wing-venation-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hoffmann-Donoughe insect wing venation — MorphoEval overall 77.8/100" ;
    rdfs:comment "Follows the authors' own procedure on their own example wing: real silhouette and primary-vein scaffold, secondary veins regenerated by Lloyd equilibration + Voronoi at the real local density. 923 real vein domains reproduced; circularity real 0.712 vs model 0.867 (hexagon ceiling 0.907). Overall 77.8/100 (faithfulness 81.1, reproducibility 70.0); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit f3fe478; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.16.3, scikit-image 0.26.0. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 85, Morphological realism / specimen match 85, Parameter expressivity 65, Morphometric validation 80, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 75, Reproducibility package 50. Output judged: hoffmann_wing_recapitulation.png: rendered output of 2018-hoffmann-wing-venation.py at f3fe478, image/png, 179027 B, 1730×1206 px, sha256 43b99ec8ae8205b3f12cfd0cde6d3ab1935463e222f66a0f5c16ec15d49e1108." ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:evaluatesHypothesis <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-hoffmann-wing-venation> ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add a circularity-vs-iteration sweep panel to show the equilibration transition.",
        "remediation needed: Add scikit-image and Pillow to requirements.txt and pin numpy >= 2.5 for Python 3.14.",
        "remediation needed: Optionally switch the Lloyd stop rule to the paper's 0.1%-of-wing-length threshold." ;
    pk:hasProbability 7.78e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-13-morphology-audit-hoffmann-wing-venation-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hoffmann-Donoughe insect wing venation — Parameter expressivity: 65/100" ;
    rdfs:comment "n_iter and seed density are exposed, but no sweep figure shows the paper's random-to-equilibrated transition in circularity. Evidence: 2018-hoffmann-wing-venation.py L150–L150: n_iter=18, seed=0 defaults; no sweep <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/f3fe478/2018-hoffmann-wing-venation.py#L150-L150>." ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
