<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-13-morphology-audit-raup-shell-coiling-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Raup shell coiling morphospace — Model fidelity to source: 35/100" ;
    rdfs:comment "W (whorl expansion) and D (distance from axis) are implemented, but axial translation is zc = T*theta (linear in angle) while the radius grows as exp(b*theta). Over 6 turns at W=2.5 the radius reaches ~244 and Z only ~30, so T is swamped. In Raup's model translation scales with whorl size (z proportional to T*r). Evidence: create_raup_animations.py L41–L41: r = np.exp(b * theta) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/f3fe478/create_raup_animations.py#L41-L41>; create_raup_animations.py L46–L46: zc = T * theta (should scale with r) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/f3fe478/create_raup_animations.py#L46-L46>; 1966-raup.py L39–L39: same formula <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/f3fe478/1966-raup.py#L39-L39>." ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:evaluatesHypothesis <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-raup-shell-coiling-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:hasProbability 3.5e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "unfaithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-13-morphology-audit-raup-shell-coiling-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Raup shell coiling morphospace — Morphometric validation: 20/100" ;
    rdfs:comment "Reference taxa are named per panel but no measured shape quantity (e.g. spire height / aperture width, apical angle) is computed or compared against specimens or Raup's figures. Evidence: create_raup_animations.py L160–L164: titles carry W, D, T only <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/f3fe478/create_raup_animations.py#L160-L164>. Measurements (measure_outputs.py): effective translation rate T_eff, 'Planispiral' (nominal T=0.1) = 0.0093 ratio (reference 0.1, Raup 1966: T is defined relative to the whorl radius, so T_eff should equal T) [Δz over the last whorl ÷ generating-curve centre radius, from raup_shell(W,D,T,turns=6)] — shell height/width = 0.028; effective translation rate T_eff, 'Turreted' (nominal T=0.8) = 0.0175 ratio (reference 0.8, Raup 1966: T is defined relative to the whorl radius, so T_eff should equal T) [Δz over the last whorl ÷ generating-curve centre radius, from raup_shell(W,D,T,turns=6)] — shell height/width = 0.052; effective translation rate T_eff, 'Disc-like' (nominal T=0.2) = 0.0005 ratio (reference 0.2, Raup 1966: T is defined relative to the whorl radius, so T_eff should equal T) [Δz over the last whorl ÷ generating-curve centre radius, from raup_shell(W,D,T,turns=6)] — shell height/width = 0.001; effective translation rate T_eff, 'Conical' (nominal T=0.5) = 0.0249 ratio (reference 0.5, Raup 1966: T is defined relative to the whorl radius, so T_eff should equal T) [Δz over the last whorl ÷ generating-curve centre radius, from raup_shell(W,D,T,turns=6)] — shell height/width = 0.074; effective translation rate T_eff, 'High-spired' (nominal T=1.2) = 0.1945 ratio (reference 1.2, Raup 1966: T is defined relative to the whorl radius, so T_eff should equal T) [Δz over the last whorl ÷ generating-curve centre radius, from raup_shell(W,D,T,turns=6)] — shell height/width = 0.583; effective translation rate T_eff, 'Wide' (nominal T=0.3) = 0.0019 ratio (reference 0.3, Raup 1966: T is defined relative to the whorl radius, so T_eff should equal T) [Δz over the last whorl ÷ generating-curve centre radius, from raup_shell(W,D,T,turns=6)] — shell height/width = 0.006." ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:evaluatesHypothesis <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-raup-shell-coiling-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:hasProbability 2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "unfaithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-13-morphology-audit-raup-shell-coiling-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Raup shell coiling morphospace — MorphoEval overall 37.3/100" ;
    rdfs:comment "The translation parameter T has no visible effect: Turritella (T=0.80), Cerithium (T=1.20) and Conus render as the same flat planispiral disc as Nautilus (T=0.10). Overall 37.3/100 (faithfulness 28.6, reproducibility 57.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit f3fe478; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.16.3, scikit-image 0.26.0. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 35, Morphological realism / specimen match 30, Parameter expressivity 25, Morphometric validation 20, Source and data traceability 65, Code-to-model traceability 45, Reproducibility package 60. Output judged: raup_shell_animation.gif: rendered output of create_raup_animations.py at f3fe478, image/gif, 24248756 B, 3600×2400 px, 161 frames, sha256 aea20e93a9a79a94a4685ba67c78684cf879030e2a3c5ff552cfad44cd43bc51." ;
